    "ls|LS16_S6_U_199": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF CULTURE \n \nLOK SABHA \n \nUNSTARRED QUESTION No. 199 \n \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 30th NOVEMBER, 2015 \n \n“SETTING UP OF NEW MUSEUMS UNDER MUSEUM GRANT SCHEME” \n199.  SHRI OM BIRLA: \nWill the Minister of CULTURE be pleased to state: \n(a) the details of number of new museums built by State Governments and other \nbodies in the country under the Museum Grant Scheme in the last three years, \nState-wise; and  \n \n(b) the details of institutions that received Museum Grant Scheme for maintaining \nexisting museums ? \n \nANSWER  \n \nMINISTER OF STATE (IC) CULTURE & TOURIS  \n \nAND  \n \nMINISTER OF STATE FOR CIVIL AVIATION \n \n(DR. MAHESH SHARMA) \n \n \n(a) The details are at Annexure - A  \n \n \n(b) The details are at Annexure – B   \n\n \nANNEXURE-A \n \nDETAILS OF NUMBER OF NEW MUSEUMS BUILT BY STATE GOVERNMENTS AND OTHER BODIES IN THE \nCOUNTRY UNDER THE MUSEUM GRANT SCHEME IN THE LAST THREE YEARS   \nS.No. State Details of Proposals Funds Released (In lakhs) \n  2012-13 2013-14 2014-15 \n1.  Jammu & Kashmir SPS Museum, Srinagar (New) - 300.00 150.00 \nRegional Museum, Leh, (J & K)   - 5.00 - \n2.  Madhya Pradesh Local Archaeological Museum, Sironj  - 40.84 - \n3.  Telengana Regional Museum of Buddhist Heritage, \nNagarjuasagar, Nalkonda Distt. (NEW) \n- 5.00 325.08 \n4.  Uttrakhand Himalayan Museum, Rishikesh (New - - 458.38 \n \nS. No. Name of Organization   Funds Released (In lakhs) \n 2012-13 2013-14 2014-2015  2015-2016 \nArunachal Pradesh   \n1.  Arunodaya Welfare Society, Tawang - 88.61 59.075 29.537 \n2.  Bright Future Society, Mumpa 75.98 40.49 40.49 53.985 \n3.  RIWATCH, Dibang Valley, Roing - - - 34.375 \nHaryana   \n4.  Heritage Transport Museum, Gurgaon - - 47.65 2.35 \n5.  Virtual Museum of Sound and Images, \nCentre for Art & Archaeology, Gurgaon \n19.17 166.33 - 74.617 \nKerala   \n6.  Guru Gopinath Natanagramam Society,  \nThiruvananthapuram \n- 90.00 90.00 120.00 \n7.  Society for Deve